    "body": "Part A of this issue is draft PR #2797 (issue #2781), head `ca3b554461c32607488a79496b9388b0206536e3`.\n\n- The PR moves the solidcore pin and adds the kernel's own `Trims` implementation. `fig8.step`, `fillet_corner.step` and `bar_cross_holes.step` read through solidcore.\n- `bspline_discontinuous.step` stays refused: an edge that is more than 0.01 mm off its face is refused by name.\n- The pin move changed three kernel test results. The PR body and `docs/decisions/917-kernel-pcurves.md` give the cause of each. No test was deleted or made weaker.\n- The gate was a narrow `--only` set by the maintainer's order. The heavy lanes run now on the same head.\n- A read-only review of the head runs now.\n\nPart B (the importer switch) stacks on #2797. Parts 2 and 3 are #2789 and #2790.\n",
