    "body": "Part A is merged: PR #2797 at head `74920e5c9facd4f3778a5e0aa8410b76fd678ff2`, merge commit `c4ac3ce6da5d79e572b82ec94bc965427cd63eeb`.\n\n- The review found one blocker (a NaN sample passed the lift check). The author fixed it, and the delta review was clean.\n- The heavy lanes were green on the merged head (232 steps).\n- Follow-up issues: #2800 (split `step_agreement.rs`) and #2802 (quadratic scans, cancel token).\n\nPart B (the importer switch in `camcraft-app`) starts now, on the new `main`. Then #2789, then #2790.\n",
